.TH _PRINTF 3 "November 2025" "Holberton School" "_printf manual"

.SH NAME
_printf - custom implementation of printf function

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include "main.h"

int _printf(const char *format, ...);
.fi

.SH DESCRIPTION
The _printf function is a lightweight, custom version of the standard C printf. It takes a format string, looks through it character by character, and prints everything to standard output. Regular characters get written directly, but whenever it runs into a %, the next character determines the conversion type and the function prints the corresponding argument.

After the %, the next character tells _printf what kind of value it should print and which argument to pull from the variadic list. Depending on the specifier, it calls helper functions to handle the actual printing.

This implementation does not support flags, field width, precision, 
or length modifiers.

.SH FORMAT SPECIFIERS

.TP
.B %d, %i
Print a signed decimal integer.

.TP
.B %c
Print a single character.

.TP
.B %s
Print a null-terminated string.

.TP
.B %%
Print a literal percent sign.

.SH RETURN VALUE
Upon successful completion, _printf() returns the number of characters printed
(excluding the terminating null byte used to end output to strings).
If an output error is encountered, the function returns \-1.

.SH ERRORS
The _printf function returns -1 in the following cases:

.TP
.B
If the format string is NULL.

.TP
.B
If a percent sign ('%') appears at the end of the format string
without a valid conversion specifier.

.SH EXAMPLES
1. Printing a string:
.br
.B _printf("Hello, %s!\\n", "Everyone!");
.br
Output:
.br
Hello, Everyone!

.PP
2. Printing an integer:
.br
.B _printf("Score: %d\\n", 98);
.br
Output:
.br
Score: 98

.PP
3. Printing a character:
.br
.B _printf("Grade: %c\\n", 'A');
.br
Output:
.br
Grade: A

.PP
4. Printing a percent sign:
.br
.B _printf("Completion: 100%%\\n");
.br
Output:
.br
Completion: 100%

.PP
5. Mixing different types:
.br
.B _printf("Name: %s, Age: %d, Initial: %c\\n", "Reem", 21, 'R');
.br
Output:
.br
Name: Reem, Age: 21, Initial: R

